## Findings

### Digest COURTS key findings
- Courts today = (a) standard kind `court` (standards R?, jurisdictions R23), superseded by later decision R6; (b) venue how=court (jur R25); (c) Tier 2/3 action kinds (records_petition, consent_decree_motion, taxpayer_action, assessment_challenge, constitutional_claim; oakland-alameda.mjs:231-244); (d) correspondence stages court_filing/court_decision + outcomes granted/denied/partial/reversed/affirmed/none stated (CORRESPONDENCE_STAGES :4118); (e) filings: Tier1-2 drafts, Tier3 counsel packet (R8-R12, six sections, never fileable), theoryPropose R14; (f) escalation stage 5 legal_tools, stage 7 testimony/audit_request/oversight_request (escalation R8, R12); (g) group-as-defendant: legal pressure mark actions R48, litigation hold R52,R56-60 (DEC-61, DEC-113); (h) jur R26 applies_to: claim limitation windows (Oakland holds none); (i) jur R39 venue evidence standard.
- GAPS: no court case/proceeding object, docket of others, parties, orders, judgments, appeals, settlements, consent decree monitoring; no precedent/"interprets" link (HO §4 U41 L71; D1 journeys §6 L531 "Following a court case" waiting); no court doctype in docprofile (meeting_minutes etc only); entities no court kind (institution/body); progressions could host a proceeding flow as DATA (CF §8.2/§9) but none named; no sub-document citation for paragraphs of orders until D-164 content extent (DEC-23); Grade A deferred (DEC-81.4) -> evidence for court use not producible; legally compelled removal no path (DEC-116.7); 0 UI calls for counselpacket/theorypropose/actionpressure/actionhold (M1); Oakland no templates -> KIND_NO_TEMPLATE; firsthand observation of hearing no basis leg (DEC-39/D-184); standing/exhaustion/filing-window checks deferred D-165.
- Journeys (D1 design-journeys §3 L106, L111): "Reading about a lawsuit the city is a party to" -> capture filings, name parties & offices, watch court docket page; "A utility's rate case before a state commission" -> capture filings, follow docket. §6 L531 gap row.
- Canon examples: Roadmap §1 L256-258 CPRA petition/Grand Jury complaint/State Controller referral; L272-274 Carachure v Azusa, Zolly v Oakland, Weatherford v San Rafael (precedent with holdings); App B L1099 Livermore settlement $3.78M; L279-281 23-year OPD consent decree, EPA consent decree, Prop 218 litigation; §2 L287-303 audits, grand jury reports; App B L1081-87 Gov Code 7923.005/.110, Penal Code 925a/919(c)/926; FA L1 Fn1 L132-136 "court decisions (case law, consent decrees)", "audit reports (City Auditor, grand jury, State Controller)"; FA Fn4 L317-319 AI surfaces precedent; FA L447 legal databases search.
- Bob reasons from CPUC (HO §2 L18; DEC-100 docket modelled on CPUC). DEC-77.2 CCCER audit finding form adopted. DEC-55 Cerebras stipulation. DEC-61/113 litigation hold. DEC-105 venue standards in profile. DEC-81.1 Grade A ceiling for legal use.
- Naming hazards: case (DEC-72 publication), docket (DEC-116 case docket), standard, obligation.
- TAD §8.2 l.917 civil suit as multi-stage clock; order a deadline origin.
- PS NO PRECEDENT l.288-290: published conclusion as input with strength inherited.

